editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/EVENT-LIST.md:42:- **"Nobody's watching."** is Brom's (he checks; the last watcher nodded to him), after Seln, who has looked for watchers on other people's behalf for fifteen years, asks that somebody else say it.
