editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:8364:     9	*Inventory, because I do one at the start of anything. I am eighteen. Nine confirmed: Wind, Pressure, Iron, Compression, Ember, Storm, Anchor, Blade, and Shadow, which costs from waking whether I use it or not and drifted twice today on a road with nobody on it. Deployment since the Line: none. One anomaly. Session nine. Still open. Still real. Patience.*
