editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11030:+   *I can work within the system. I have the receipts: a hearing, a provision, two renewals on paper, a tournament their own clause put me in. The system has text, and text has held me every time the people failed. This is more text. We'll read it better than they do. We always have.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11038:+   "Nobody's watching," said Brom.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11044:+   "Nobody's watching," said Lira.
