editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11130:+**CLOSE WITH FIXES.** All six marker units exist in the source and must be restored. The closing inventory also has protected source wording; the packet's protection is not cancelled by its omission from `BOOK_MAP.md` §8. The source last line is binding through the Book 7 seam and must replace the author's paraphrase. Three attribution rulings require repair: Lira, not Brom, first says “Nobody's watching”; “Both promises ride east with me” is a log entry, not speech to Lira; and Karis, not Cael, says/writes “Noted.” Lira's and Brom's two lines in the closing exchange are correct.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11142:+Governing text: `BOOK_MAP.md:618` protects “Gault's last note, ending *The instruments will not see its like.*” The complete source unit is:
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11144:+> *Assay-provision enrollment: resigned in good standing prior to revocation date. Baseline file: closed complete. Four terms of evaluation-linked observation, no adverse finding, no anomaly of conduct. The evaluator of record notes that the file closes on the enrollee's own act and not the registry's, and that this is the correct closing, and the only just one available. The instruments will not see its like.* (`books/book-06-the-compacts-hand/chapters/chapter-21.md:59`)
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11175:+No standing-ruling change is needed inside the protected reply. The following sentence does need the separately listed join fix: the restored reply is not usefully described there as “short.”
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11185:+### B1. Closing inventory — protected source wording exists
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-009/protected-text.stdout.log:11189:+Required standing-ruling change: source `Nine integrated abilities` becomes **`Nine fragments`**. All other source wording stays unchanged. The author's second anomaly procedure is removed because the restored source entry already contains the protected anomaly wording and its closing *Still open. Still real. Patience.*
