+| Character attachment | 9/10 | Ch. 56, Brom leaving the letter sealed; Ch. 57, Seln looking back at the lamp; Ch. 60, Karis's unclosable archive | Each character's cost is personal and active. The emotional restraint increases credibility rather than flattening the relationships. | High |
