+| Progression payoff | 9/10 | Ch. 59, “There was no threshold”; Ch. 60, “The boy who wrote that had not been a fool. He had only been early.” | Mechanical discipline, intellectual revision, and social independence converge. The final power accounting serves character rather than interrupting it, despite its density. | High |
+| Connection | 10/10 | Ch. 55, Bracken's margin; Ch. 57, true empty reports; Ch. 60, the unsigned fifth line reopening the file | The movement transforms its central motifs instead of merely repeating them. Chapter-to-chapter causality and end-state handoff are unusually strong. | High |
+| Read-aloud quality | 9/10 | Ch. 57, Seln on the crest; Ch. 59, the Line crossing; Ch. 60, final four paragraphs | The prose has controlled oral rhythm and clear speakers. Only the densest institutional and inventory paragraphs strain one-pass listening. | High |
